# A termcraft project created by running the app against the repository root itself (a dev
# convenience). It is live local state — a lease, chats, transactions — never repository content.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing. Example projects under examples/*/.termcraft/ ARE
# repository content, and termcraft writes its own .termcraft/.gitignore
# (src/store/toml/model/gitignore.ts) that already excludes the machine-local paths — the
# lease, workspace.local.toml, transactions.local/, caches and logs. Never widen this rule
# to an unanchored `.termcraft/`; that would silently stop tracking every example.
/.termcraft/

HANDOFF.md

# The diagnostic trace (infrastructure/debug-log, TERMCRAFT_DEBUG_LOG). One JSONL file per
# run, kept to a retention cap — a debugging artifact, never repository content. The bare
# filename is the pre-2026-07-27 single-file form; it stays listed so a checkout that still
# has one does not suddenly start tracking it.
termcraft-debug/
termcraft-debug.jsonl
